{
  "_provenance": "Authored OnlineBoutique topology for the RCAEval RE2-OB adapter. Dependency edges follow the public Google microservices-demo architecture (RCAEval's RE2 deployment); criticality and level are authored priors (level = topological depth over DEPENDS_ON). No benchmark labels are used: the entity list is exactly the union of telemetry column prefixes observed in the dataset (adservice..shippingservice plus redis, frontend-external, istio-init).",
  "services": [
